    "text": "package P is\n\n   type R is record\n      A : Integer;\n      B : Integer;\n   end record;\n\n   --  Representation clause for record R:\n   for R use record\n      A at 0 range 0 .. 31;\n      --   ^ starting memory position\n      B at 4 range 0 .. 31;\n      --           ^ first bit .. last bit\n   end record;\n\nend P;\n",
